<title>DUBAI: Iran's NIOC sets new bunker fuel price.</title>
<headline>Iran's NIOC sets new bunker fuel price.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Iranian Oil Company (NIOC) has set the price of its 280-cst bunker fuel oil from Kharg Island at $101 a tonne and $96 from Bandar Mahshahr.</p>
<p>Prices are effective June 19, the company said.</p>
</text>
